<title>BELGIUM: Cofinimmo maintains dividend forecast.</title>
<headline>Cofinimmo maintains dividend forecast.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit		  980    vs     n/a</p>
<p>    Rentals			  1,342    vs     n/a</p>
<p>    Sales of lease receivables 2,231    vs     n/a</p>
<p>    Operating profit	     3,179    vs     n/a</p>
<p>    Current pre tax profit     2,909    vs     n/a</p>
<p>    Taxes			    1,929    vs     n/a</p>
<p>Forecast gross dividend for year (francs)  194</p>
<p>NOTE - Cofinimmo is a listed real estate investment fund. Comparable data is not available due to restructuring this year.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
